The {{Term/Store|Salvager Trousers|Salvager Trousers|Series, BotW}} are an [[Item]] in {{BotW}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Salvager Trousers are a piece of [[Armor]] in {{BotW}}, part of the [[Salvager Armor Set]]. They are obtained from a [[Treasure Chest]] as part of the "[[Xenoblade Chronicles 2|[Xenoblade Chronicles 2]]]" [[Side Quest]]. The Chest crashes on a plateau on the southern side of the [[Hebra East Summit]] after [[Link]] looks to the southeastern sky from the [[Hebra Peak]] during the night. After obtaining the Salvager Trousers, [[Granté]] will begin selling them for 50 [[Rupee]]s. When worn, the Salvager Trousers provide one level of [[Swim Speed Up]]. The Salvager Trousers cannot be [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d by a [[Great Fairy]], nor can they be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

